## Why This Is Asked

This question probes end-to-end system design for real-time NLP with multilingual support, external knowledge integration, privacy, and production rollout controls.

## Key Concepts

- Retrieval-augmented verification
- Multilingual embedding alignment
- Privacy-preserving retrieval (on-device, encrypted channels)
- Streaming knowledge graphs and evidence routing
- Drift detection and canary rollout security

## Code Example

```javascript
async function verifyClaim(msg, lang){
  const q = encodeClaim(msg, lang);
  const docs = await retriever.retrieve(q);
  const res = verifier.score(docs, msg);
  return {score: res.score, justification: res.justification};
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you scale the retriever as the knowledge base grows?
- How would you monitor drift and trigger rollback automatically?

